    <informations>Shelly Plus 2PM — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: N O1 L L O2 S1 S2.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-plus-2pm
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_dd7fddf549171363128dd58d3361fe574578383cdf0b58d7b78043703a5f7614/Shelly-Plus-2PM.jpg?cb=41bd6be66a86ab52e77d8eb0ee683312
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_9106867feb96a5e3cef52fab0824434ed715c2a969981ab2a374f0952f7ed6b4/Plus-2PM-internal-schematics.png?cb=86a87d3ce260b85fca549aedb9eb7ac4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_ac261be43a9f933628de6b212b3ba18ec8a7806d416761c1d98ee0312ba70727/Shelly%20Plus%202PM%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=72692b2c8e2b535f89c1f809b3a903d1

Notes:
- Neutral is leftmost on Plus 2PM; the Gen3/Gen4 order is different.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
